hermes-wikiskill
================

This distribution is derived from WikiSkill (PyPI `wikiskill` 0.1.5,
https://github.com/ashutoshsinghpr7/wikiskill, commit cdc291c), an
implementation of "WikiSkill" (arXiv:2608.27454), released under the MIT
License. The upstream copyright notice is retained in LICENSE.

Kept from upstream: the paper's Algorithm 1 (train rollouts -> wiki maintainer
-> skill proposer -> validation gate accepting iff R_val > R_best, rollback of
skills only), the workspace layout, the task/grader schema, the maintainer and
proposer role skills, and the CLI verbs.

Changed: Hermes-only backend with skills visibility verification, pure
dry-runs, minimal per-run credentials, Hermes feature detection, held-out
evaluation, workspace locking, path containment, checked git operations,
train-only grader feedback. See README.md (defects D1-D18, plus sealed val/test answer keys); every fix is pinned by tests/.
Dropped: the claude/codex/copilot backends and the upstream demo bench
generator (replaced by the bundled house-report bench).
